;; The manual says why PAUSE and not just SOUND: with RECORD SOUND on,
;; "the SOUNDs and the PAUSEs that determine their length" both have to
;; add codes to the string being recorded, so PAUSE needs a hook of its
;; own.
;; --------------------------------------------------------------------

