               DEC L                           ; 5F23 2D
               JR NZ,L5F1B                     ; 5F24 20 F5
               LD A,&01                        ; 5F26 3E 01  error 1, "Out of memory"
               JP REPORT                       ; 5F28 C3 BE 43

